7489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"As long as we're here, might as well make sure we're using the proper argument syntax. Applies to all functions touched in this script.\r\n```suggestion\r\nconstexpr uint64_t next_power_of_2(uint64_t p_x) {\r\n\tif (p_x == 0) {\r\n\t\treturn 0;\r\n\t}\r\n\r\n\t--p_x;\r\n\tp_x |= p_x >> 1;\r\n\tp_x |= p_x >> 2;\r\n\tp_x |= p_x >> 4;\r\n\tp_x |= p_x >> 8;\r\n\tp_x |= p_x >> 16;\r\n\tp_x |= p_x >> 32;\r\n\r\n\treturn ++p_x;\r\n}\r\n```","created_at":"2025-05-20T16:53:54Z","updated_at":"2025-05-20T16:53:54Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106606#discussion_r2098456282","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106606","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2098456282"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106606#discussion_r2098456282"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106606"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2098456282/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line